Look for: a time limit or end point.
Example: Please wait here until the doctor calls you.
Watch out: Do not use will after until: wait until he arrives, not wait until he will arrive.', '[{"label":"When to use","text":"To say an action continues up to a certain time or event and then stops."},{"label":"Look for","text":"a time limit or end point."},{"label":"Example","text":"Please wait here until the doctor calls you."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"Do not use will after until: wait until he arrives, not wait until he will arrive."}]', 2414);
