Look for: one of these verbs, including Would you mind…?
Example: Would you mind opening the window?
Watch out: Not Would you mind to open; practised playing, not practised to play.', '[{"label":"When to use","text":"After admit, mind and practise."},{"label":"Look for","text":"one of these verbs, including Would you mind…?"},{"label":"Example","text":"Would you mind opening the window?"},{"label":"Watch out","text":"Not Would you mind to open; practised playing, not practised to play."}]', 3716);
