Look for: recommend + -ing, or recommend that + subject + base verb.
Examples: I recommend booking early. I recommend that you book early.
Watch out: Not I recommend to book. recommend us to book is sometimes heard, but recommend booking or a that-clause is the safer choice.', '[{"label":"When to use","text":"To report a recommendation."},{"label":"Look for","text":"recommend + -ing, or recommend that + subject + base verb."},{"label":"Examples","text":"I recommend booking early. I recommend that you book early."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"Not I recommend to book. recommend us to book is sometimes heard, but recommend booking or a that-clause is the safer choice."}]', 3720);
