Watch out: In the passive, to comes back: was made to repeat, not was made repeat.', '[{"label":"When to use","text":"When make, see or hear is used in the passive."},{"label":"Look for","text":"was made / was seen / was heard + to + base verb."},{"label":"Example","text":"He was made to repeat the exam."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"In the passive, to comes back: was made to repeat, not was made repeat."}]', 3724);
