Watch out: Do not change the words: Be that as it may, not Be that is it may; Come what may, not Comes what may.', '[{"label":"When to use","text":"These are set expressions; learn them as whole phrases."},{"label":"Look for","text":"Be that as it may = even so; Come what may = whatever happens; So be it = I accept it; Far be it from me to… = I don''t want to…"},{"label":"Example","text":"Come what may, I will finish this project."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"Do not change the words: Be that as it may, not Be that is it may; Come what may, not Comes what may."}]', 4422);
