Key difference: Use either If we had known… or Had we known….
Example: If we had known, we would have stayed at home.
Watch out: Not If had we known: keep normal word order after if.', '[{"label":"When to use","text":"When choosing between a normal if-sentence and the formal version without if."},{"label":"Key difference","text":"Use either If we had known… or Had we known…."},{"label":"Example","text":"If we had known, we would have stayed at home."},{"label":"Watch out","text":"Not If had we known: keep normal word order after if."}]', 4925);
